ument_title_status":""},"say:7:1422691705:1":{"text":"시타, 영원히, 살아... 양분, 있으면...","source_cn":"悉达、将、永远、存在、只要、养分……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3DAE3D2A689E2640","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1422691706:1":{"text":"뿌리, 영양. 시타... 다시 강해져...","source_cn":"根系、营养、悉达、再次、壮大……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2557975A50ED667E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1422691707:1":{"text":"시타, 번식해, 더 많이, 더 많이...","source_cn":"悉达、繁衍、更多、更多……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x98AD775F6586039A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1422691708:0":{"text":"시타, 뿌리 있어, 씨앗 있어. 숲이 되어, 숲을 삼켜...","source_cn":"悉达、有根、有种子、变成丛林、吃掉丛林……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x13C1C75DF4B44625","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1422691709:0":{"text":"시타, 숲이 될 거야...\n시타가, 숲이야...","source_cn":"悉达、会成为丛林……\\n悉达、就是丛林……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x395C714F30E58AE4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1422691710:0":{"text":"...닥쳐라, 악마!","source_cn":"……闭嘴，恶魔！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x035B09C11DD46C66","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1422691711:1":{"text":"에이론, 진정하십시오! 지금 악마의 말에서 최대한 정보를 얻어야 합니다.","source_cn":"埃隆，冷静！既然她在回答，我们得问出更多情报。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE543B19901B13513","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1422691712:0":{"text":"저 악마를 상대할 방법을 찾아야 해요!","source_cn":"我们得找到对付她的办法！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3831D3A5580568A9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:16:1422691712":{"text":"저 악마를 상대할 방법을 찾아야 해요!","source_cn":"我们得想办法找到对付她的办法！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3831D3A5580568A9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1422691713:1":{"text":"시타, 그냥, 열매를 찾았어...","source_cn":"悉达、只是、找到了果实……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9D1987885B9D0B40","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1422691714:1":{"text":"시타, 들켰어, 듀라. 봉인, 도망쳤어...","source_cn":"悉达、被发现、艾雅、封印、逃离……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD98EBA70E6009B71","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1422691715:1":{"text":"하지만 시타, 뿌리 내렸어. 하지만, 열매, 없어...","source_cn":"但悉达、扎下了根、可是、果实只剩……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x26F33501119BE8FA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1422691716:0":{"text":"시타의 뿌리, 멀리 멀리, 시타, 지하는, 안전해...","source_cn":"悉达的根、越走越远、悉达、地下、安全了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF4D75767531A861E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1422691717:1":{"text":"그러다, 불이 났어. 시타, 무서워, 하지만, 뿌리 있어...","source_cn":"后来、有火、悉达、怕、但还有、根系……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3BE818CBFA9D4620","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1422691718:0":{"text":"너희, 양분. 시타, 즐거워...","source_cn":"你们、会是养分、悉达、很开心……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5E6590EB42AAB625","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1422691719:0":{"text":"이리 와, 시타에게. 영원, 존재하게...","source_cn":"来吧、供给、悉达、永存……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x388AC7C6CE97ABC2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:25:1422691719":{"text":"이리 와, 시타에게. 영원, 존재하게...","source_cn":"来吧、供给、悉达、永存……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x388AC7C6CE97ABC2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1422691720:1":{"text":"불이 약점인 것 같습니다! 시도해 보지요!","source_cn":"火焰或许是她的克星！试试吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8443896A7F55C177","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1422691721:1":{"text":"씨앗을 전부 불태워 부활할 방법을 막으면 됩니다.","source_cn":"我们焚毁她所有的种子，切断她的重生之路。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4FC5FA3FEC110E1D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1422691722:1":{"text":"그리고 뿌리를 끊어서 힘을 흡수하는 길을 차단하죠!","source_cn":"还要破坏她的根系，阻断她汲取力量的渠道。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x733743C36E024AFD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:30:1422691723:1":{"text":"제가 해보겠습니다. 먼 곳의 적을 반드시 맞춘다는 둔가엘에는...","source_cn":"让我来试试吧，万里逐敌，开弓必中的杜恩加尔——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0B3231A7D5A27837","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:31:1422691724:1":{"text":"헥토르와 드래곤의 불꽃이 깃들어 있으니, 안성맞춤일 겁니다.","source_cn":"它凝聚了赫托与龙的火焰精粹，正适合焚烧这些。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x71D